=2 Walkthrough
!Castle Oztroja-map7.jpg|right|Tebhi's Spawn Area
* Speak to {n:Brutus} at (G-7) in {z:Upper Jeuno} who will give you three {k:Aquaflora} {p:Key Items|Key Item}.

>**You can be on any job from here on.**
* Examine the pools on map 2 of {z:Fei'Yin} located at (H-8), (H-5) and lastly (F-5). They are the little green marks on the map.
** {p:Home Point} #2 is the closest warp just outside of the {z:Cloister of Frost}
* When the pool located at (F-5) is inspected an NM named {m:Dabotz's Ghost} will spawn. The ghost can actually spawn at any pool but it seems (F-5) was only available after the other 2 were used.
** {m:Dabotz's Ghost} is a {p:Black Mage} and can cast various {s:Black Magic} spells including {s:Tornado}.
** {m:Dabotz's Ghost} uses {p:curse|Curse} often.
** Take off Sneak if you have it on, he will spawn in the water of the pool and you can't get to him unless he aggros you.
* After defeating {m:Dabotz's Ghost}, check the pool at (F-5) again.
* Return to {n:Brutus} for a cutscene.
* Next head to {z:Castle Oztroja} and kill the monsters to find an {i:Oztroja Chest Key|Oztroja Chest Key|1035}.
** Alternatively, you can purchase one from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}.
* Use the key to open a chest inside the castle to receive a {i:Beast Collar|Beast Collar|13121}.
* Trade the {i:Beast Collar|Beast Collar|13121} to the Opo-opo NPC {n:Tebhi}.
** {n:Tebhi} likes to roam the indoor pond that is near the brass door to the magicite for city missions.
** {n:Tebhi} will dissapear for 3 minutes after accepting the {i:Beast Collar|Beast Collar|13121}.
* Return to {n:Brutus} for your reward.

